---
---
<section id="stories" class="py-20 bg-[#F5EBE1]/60">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Poster Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="p-1 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-md">
          <img 
            src="/dog-kennel-hill-poster.jpg" 
            alt="Dog Kennel Hill Adventure Playground Fundraiser Poster" 
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-2xl object-cover" 
          />
          <div class="p-3 text-center">
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-light">Poster by <a href="https://www.instagram.com/sara.pof/" target="_blank">SARA POF</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text Column Next to Poster -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-stone-200/80 text-stone-700 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
          <span>Inaugural Fundraiser Event</span>
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-stone-900 leading-tight mb-6">
          Dog Kennel Hill Adventure Playground
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-stone-700 font-light text-xl leading-relaxed text-pretty">
          Our very first event brought the community together to raise vital funds for the incredible local music charity <a class="underline font-bold" href="https://youthsayers.net/about%20us/" target="_blank">Youthsayers</a>, at the
          Dog Kennel Hill Adventure Playground — both sanctuaries for young people in South London. Entry was free, and through food, dancing, and donations we demonstrated the power of music and solidarity.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
